  m_text: "HOW TO PLAY:\nEnter an area and observe it well. On your subsequent runs
    through that area, something will be different. That is an anomaly.\nIf you notice
    a room contains an anomaly, please enter the elevator from which you came from.
    \nIf an area is clear of anomalies, proceed to the elevator at the end of the
    level. \nAll players must be present in the elevator for your choice to be registered.
    \nDon't stray too far from one another.\nYou don't know what lurks in the dark\n:]"
